      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 1006,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## System: Model Store\n- **Kind:** database\n- **Purpose:** Durable model and deployment records.\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **URL:** https://console.example.internal/model-store",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "system",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Model Store",
          "purpose": "Durable model and deployment records.",
          "kind": "database",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "url": "https://console.example.internal/model-store"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-model-manifest",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 584,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "## Schema: Model Manifest\n- **Contract kind:** api\n- **Version:** 1.2.0\n- **Owner:** Forge\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.2.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-10-15\n- **Review interval (days):** 90",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Model Manifest",
          "kind": "api",
          "version": "1.2.0",
          "owner": "Forge",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.2.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-10-15",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 90,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/schemas/model-manifest/1.2.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Model Manifest\",\n  \"description\": \"A publishable model artifact record.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"model_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1\n    },\n    \"model_family\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"version\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"pattern\": \"^[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+$\"\n    },\n    \"artifact_uri\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"uri\"\n    },\n    \"image_digest\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"pattern\": \"^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$\"\n    },\n    \"owner\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"created_at\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"model_id\",\n    \"version\",\n    \"artifact_uri\",\n    \"image_digest\",\n    \"owner\",\n    \"created_at\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-deployment-record",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "## Schema: Deployment Record\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.1.0\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** needs_review\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-04-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 90",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Deployment Record",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.1.0",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "needs_review",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-04-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 90,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/schemas/deployment-record/1.1.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Deployment Record\",\n  \"description\": \"The observed runtime deployment of a model.\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"deployment_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"model_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"environment\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"staging\",\n        \"production\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"image_digest\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"pattern\": \"^sha256:[a-f0-9]{64}$\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"planned\",\n        \"deploying\",\n        \"active\",\n        \"failed\",\n        \"retired\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"deployed_at\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    },\n    \"deployed_by\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"deployment_id\",\n    \"model_id\",\n    \"environment\",\n    \"image_digest\",\n    \"status\",\n    \"deployed_at\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
